<h2>Your auto-applied discount code has reached its usage limit</h2>

<p>Hi <%= @seller.display_name %>,</p>

<p>The discount code "<%= @offer_code.code %>" that was automatically applied to your product "<%= @product.name %>" has reached its maximum number of uses (<%= @offer_code.max_purchase_count %>).</p>

<p>Your product is now being sold at the regular price. If you'd like to continue offering a discount:</p>

<ol>
  <li>Go to your product's edit page</li>
  <li>Navigate to the Pricing section</li>
  <li>Select a different active discount code, or increase the usage limit of the current code in your Discounts settings</li>
</ol>

<p><%= link_to "Edit your product", Routes.edit_link_url(@product) %></p>

<p>Best,<br />The Gumroad Team</p>
